{
  "dom_id": "step-q73488",
  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Calculate ${f}^{\u2032}(x)$  for $f(x)=5-2\\operatorname{arccos}\u2061x.$",
  "worked_solution": "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}\u2061x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5-2\\operatorname{arccos}\u2061x) \\\\  & =0-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}\u2061x) \\\\  & =-2(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
